.TH MASSSPRING 1
.SH NAME
massspring \- mass-spring sandbox
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/massspring
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I MassSpring
is a mass-spring sandbox.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Button 1 places masses; button-2 drag connects springs. Enter clears the world.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB
Place mass
.TP
.B RMB drag
Connect spring between masses
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/massspring.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR ode (2),
.IR wm (1)
